# A load through the PS link, as the SD menu does it (M5 step 5.9;
# Makefile ci-arty-gg, ROM raster.gg in the harness's DDR): part way into
# frame 3 (wait counts microseconds, a frame is 16.7 ms) the PS holds the
# machine, writes the cartridge word (Sega mapper, 4 banks: bytes 00 03 at
# Gg.Machine.cartAddr) and lets go. The machine must start afresh on the
# ROM, so raster.s's picture is the golden again (every frame the same once
# it runs); PS_IN must say system 7.
wait 44000
hold 1
wait 200
bytes 0 0003
wait 100
hold 0
